#: pop3.cc:250
msgid "PASS <your password>"
msgstr "PASS <your password>"

#: pop3.cc:253
msgid "The server said: \"%1\""
msgstr "सर्भरले भन्यो :\"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:275
msgid "The server terminated the connection."
msgstr "सर्भरले जडान कार्य एकिकृत पार्यो।"

#: pop3.cc:277
msgid ""
"Invalid response from server:\n"
"\"%1\""
msgstr ""
"सर्भरबाट अबैध प्रतिकृया:\n"
"\"%1\""

#: pop3.cc:306
msgid "Could not send to server.\n"
msgstr "सर्भरसंग पठाउन सकिएन।\n"

#: pop3.cc:361 pop3.cc:420 pop3.cc:617
msgid "No authentication details supplied."
msgstr "प्रमाणीकरण विवरणहरू पूर्ति गरिएको छैन।"

#: pop3.cc:398
msgid ""
"Login via APOP failed. The server %1 may not support APOP, although it "
"claims to support it, or the password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"via APOP लगइन असफलभयो। APOP ले समर्थन जनाउन दाबि गर्दछ वा पासवर्ड गलत हुन सक्तछ तेसैले सर्भर %1 ले APOP समर्थन गरेन।\n"
"\n"
"%2"

#: pop3.cc:586
msgid ""
"Login via SASL (%1) failed. The server may not support %2, or the password "
"may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%3"
msgstr ""
"via SASL (%1)लगइन असफल भयो । सर्भरले %2 समर्थन गर्न सक्तैन, वा पासवर्ड गलत हुन सक्छ।\n"
"\n"
"%3"

#: pop3.cc:595
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support SASL.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"तँपाइको POP3 सर्भरले SASL समर्थन गरेन।\n"
"एउटा फरक प्रमाणीकरण विधि छनौट गर्नुहोस्।"

#: pop3.cc:603
msgid "SASL authentication is not compiled into kio_pop3."
msgstr "SASL प्रमाणीकरणले kio pop3 मा कम्पाइल गरेको छैन।"

#: pop3.cc:635 pop3.cc:684
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"%1 संग लगइन हुन सकेन।\n"
"\n"

#: pop3.cc:649
msgid ""
"Could not login to %1. The password may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"%1 मा लगइन हुन सक्तैन। पासवर्ड गलत हुन सक्छ।\n"
"\n"
"%2"

#: pop3.cc:687
msgid "The server terminated the connection immediately."
msgstr "सर्भर एकिकृतले जडान छिटो हुन्छ।"

#: pop3.cc:688
msgid ""
"Server does not respond properly:\n"
"%1\n"
msgstr ""
"सर्भरले उचित प्रतिकृया गर्दैन:\n"
"%1\n"

#: pop3.cc:716
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support APOP.\n"
"Choose a different authentication method."
msgstr ""
"तपाइँको POP3 सर्भरले APOP समर्थन गर्दैन।\n"
"एउटा छुट्टै प्रमाणीकरण विधि रोज्नुहोस्।"

#: pop3.cc:736
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server claims to support TLS but negotiation was unsuccessful. You "
"can disable TLS in KDE using the crypto settings module."
msgstr "तपाइँको POP3 सर्भरले TLS समर्थन गर्न दावि गर्दछ तर निगोसियसन असक्षम थियो। तपाइँ क्रिप्टो सेटिङ्स मड्यूल प्रयोग गरेर KDE मा TLS अक्षम बनाउन सक्नुहुन्छ।"

#: pop3.cc:747
msgid ""
"Your POP3 server does not support TLS. Disable TLS, if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr "तपाइँको POP3 सर्भरले TLS समर्थन गर्दैन। यदि तपाइँ केहि नगरि नै जडान गर्न चाहानु हुन्छ भने TLS अक्षम पार्नुहोस्।"

#: pop3.cc:756
msgid "Username and password for your POP3 account:"
msgstr "तपाइँको  POP3 खाता को लागि  प्रयोगकर्ता नाम र पासवर्ड:"

#: pop3.cc:956 pop3.cc:965 pop3.cc:1104
msgid "Unexpected response from POP3 server."
msgstr " POP3 सर्भरबाट अचानक प्रतिकृया।"

